# Copy to .publish-public.denylist at the root of the private repo.
# Do not commit that copy. The secrets list itself must stay untracked.
#
# A line starting with "regex " is an extended regular expression.
# A line starting with "literal " is an exact string.
# Any other non-comment line is an exact string.
# Rules shorter than 4 characters are rejected.
#
# Add the real team ID, Mac hostname, username, home path, email addresses,
# device model, and business name here as literals, one per line.
# The shape rules below are examples. Fixture and test paths can be ignored
# with denylist_allow in .publish-public.yml.

regex vg_live_[A-Za-z0-9_-]{8,}
regex AKIA[0-9A-Z]{16}
regex ghp_[A-Za-z0-9]{20,}
regex github_pat_[A-Za-z0-9_]{20,}
regex sk_live_[A-Za-z0-9]{8,}
regex -----BEGIN [A-Z0-9 ]*PRIVATE KEY-----
